# Security Tasks for Production Deployment

## 🔐 API Security Implementation

### 1. Request Authentication
- [ ] Implement API Key system for external requests
- [ ] Add request signing for sensitive endpoints
- [ ] Set up IP whitelisting for production servers
- [ ] Implement device fingerprinting
- [ ] Add request origin validation

### 2. Rate Limiting
- [ ] Configure different rate limits for:
  - [ ] Frontend requests (1000/minute)
  - [ ] External API requests (100/minute)
  - [ ] Authentication endpoints (10/minute)
- [ ] Set up Redis for rate limiting
- [ ] Add rate limit headers to responses

### 3. CORS & Origin Protection
- [ ] Configure CORS for production domains
- [ ] Set up trusted origins list
- [ ] Implement origin validation middleware
- [ ] Add security headers:
  - [ ] Content-Security-Policy
  - [ ] X-Frame-Options
  - [ ] X-Content-Type-Options
  - [ ] Strict-Transport-Security

## 🔒 Data Security

### 1. Sensitive Data Protection
- [ ] Implement data encryption for sensitive fields
- [ ] Add data masking for logs
- [ ] Set up secure file upload handling
- [ ] Implement secure password storage

### 2. Session Management
- [ ] Configure secure session settings
- [ ] Implement session timeout
- [ ] Add session invalidation on security events
- [ ] Set up secure cookie handling

## 🛡️ Infrastructure Security

### 1. Server Security
- [ ] Enable HTTPS only
- [ ] Configure SSL/TLS settings
- [ ] Set up firewall rules
- [ ] Implement IP blocking for suspicious activity

### 2. Monitoring & Logging
- [ ] Set up security event logging
- [ ] Implement automated alerts for:
  - [ ] Failed login attempts
  - [ ] Suspicious IP activity
  - [ ] Rate limit violations
  - [ ] Security policy violations
- [ ] Configure log rotation and retention

## 🔍 Security Testing

### 1. Vulnerability Assessment
- [ ] Run security scan
- [ ] Perform penetration testing
- [ ] Conduct API security testing
- [ ] Test rate limiting effectiveness

### 2. Compliance
- [ ] GDPR compliance check
- [ ] Data protection audit
- [ ] Security policy review
- [ ] Privacy policy update

