## 📅 Timeline

### Phase 1: Basic Security (Week 1)
- [ ] Implement API key system
- [ ] Set up basic rate limiting
- [ ] Configure CORS
- [ ] Enable HTTPS

### Phase 2: Enhanced Security (Week 2)
- [ ] Implement request signing
- [ ] Set up IP whitelisting
- [ ] Configure security headers
- [ ] Set up monitoring

### Phase 3: Advanced Security (Week 3)
- [ ] Implement WAF
- [ ] Set up DDoS protection
- [ ] Configure advanced monitoring
- [ ] Implement 2FA

### Phase 4: Testing & Documentation (Week 4)
- [ ] Conduct security testing
- [ ] Update documentation
- [ ] Create incident response plan
- [ ] Set up maintenance procedures

## 📌 Notes
- All security measures should be tested in staging environment first
- Regular security audits should be scheduled
- Keep security documentation up to date
- Monitor security logs regularly
- Update security measures based on new threats 